- MT91     : (n,n') continuum cross section                       2025 1451
- MT102    : (n,gamma) cross section                              2025 1451
                                                                  2025 1451
Below 500 keV, resonance parameters are used.                     2025 1451
                                                                  2025 1451
- MT103    : (n,p) cross section                                  2025 1451
- MT104    : (n,d) cross section                                  2025 1451
- MT105    : (n,t) cross section                                  2025 1451
